    <article class="legal-body">
      <p>By using onceuponatime.org or enrolling in a program, you agree to these terms. Please read carefully — and reach out at <a href="mailto:contact@onceuponatime.org">contact@onceuponatime.org</a> with questions.</p>
      <h2>Eligibility &amp; accounts</h2>
      <p>You must be 18 or older to create an account. If you're enrolling a child, you must be the parent or legal guardian.</p>
      <h2>Donations</h2>
      <p>Donations are non-refundable except where required by law, but you may request that a refund be issued in cases of fraud or duplicate payment within 30 days. Donations are tax-deductible to the extent allowed; you'll receive a written receipt at the donation email.</p>
      <h2>Class enrollment &amp; cancellation</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Full refunds are available up to 14 days before a program start date.</li>
        <li>Within 14 days of start, refunds become program credit redeemable within 12 months.</li>
        <li>If OUAT cancels a session for any reason, you'll receive a full refund.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Conduct</h2>
      <p>OUAT is committed to a safe, welcoming, harassment-free environment. We reserve the right to remove participants who endanger or harass others, with full or partial refund at our discretion.</p>
      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>Participation in arts education programs includes physical activity. The signed waiver at enrollment governs liability terms.</p>
      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>Site content (text, images, logos) belongs to OUAT or our licensors. Personal, non-commercial use is permitted; reproduction requires written permission.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms; the "Last updated" date will reflect the change. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance.</p>
    </article>

